# per kind: n = 2000 and 8000 modify/modifyGet steps on a reference whose value only the cell holds; in place, as natively (a copy per step would add n elements per step)
arr 2000 | arr 8000 | 1 1000
arrpt 2000 | arrpt 8000 | 1 1000
str 2000 | str 8000 | 1 1000
pt 2000 | pt 8000 | 1 1000
list 2000 | list 8000 | 1 1000
nat 2000 | nat 8000 | 1 1000
u32 2000 | u32 8000 | 1 1000
